entries[172459] = { ["name"] = "Headdress of the First Shaman", ["text"] = "2 sec cast 10\nLearning to speak with the elemental spirits of Draenor was a pivotal achievement in destiny the Orc clans. Many clans claim the mythical \"First Shaman\" arose from their ranks, but the truth is that no one is sure of his or her allegiance.\nHeaddress of the First Shaman\nBinds to Warband\nHead Mail\n8 Armor\n+5 [Agility or Intellect]+7 Stamina\n+ 4 Critical Strike\n+ 4 Haste\nDurability 85 / 85\nUse: Allows you to see far into the distance. (1 Min Cooldown)\n35" }
